/hasWeight","description":"The InstanceVariable whose values were used as weights when computing the Statistic entries (inline cdifInstanceVariable node or an @id-reference).","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/hasWeight"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection","cdif:has_Statistics","cdi:statistic"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/statistic","description":"Ordered list of Statistic value objects carried by this bundle. Order is significant \u2014 consumers MAY rely on array position.","required":true,"schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/statistic"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection","cdif:has_Statistics","cdi:statistic","cdi:typeOfNumericValue"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/typeOfNumericValue","description":"The type of numeric value carried in cdi:content \u2014 decimal, float, or double.","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/typeOfNumericValue"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection","cdif:has_Statistics","cdi:statistic","cdi:isWeighted"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/isWeighted","description":"True if the statistic was computed using a weighting variable.","schema_type":"boolean","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/isWeighted"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection","cdif:has_Statistics","cdi:statistic","cdi:content"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/content","description":"The value of the statistic expressed as a real number.","schema_type":"number","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/content"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection","cdif:has_Statistics","cdi:statistic","cdi:computationBase"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/computationBase","description":"The cases included in determining the statistic \u2014 Total (all cases, valid and missing), ValidOnly (valid values only), MissingOnly (invalid cases only).","schema_type":"string","enum":["MissingOnly","Total","ValidOnly"],"sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/computationBase"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection","cdif:has_Statistics","cdi:typeOfStatistic"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/typeOfStatistic","description":"Controlled-vocabulary entry naming the kind of statistic \u2014 e.g. mean, median, count, sum, stdDev.","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/typeOfStatistic"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection","cdif:indexedBy"],"id":"https://w3id.org/cdif/indexedBy","description":"CDIF addition (not in canonical DDI-CDI): the InstanceVariable(s) the contained Statistics index \u2014 the collection-level coordinate space. Marks the collection as per-variable-scoped: a StatisticsCollection carrying `cdif:indexedBy` MUST be attached via `schema:variableMeasured[i].cdif:isDescribedBy_StatisticsCollection` on one of the indexed variables, NOT at Dataset level via `cdif:statistics` (which is reserved for genuinely dataset-scope aggregates like row count).","schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifStatistics"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/cdif/indexedBy"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdi:source"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/source","description":"Reference capturing provenance information for this InstanceVariable (InstanceVariable.source).","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/source"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdi:platformType"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/platformType","description":"The application or technical system context in which the variable has been realized - typically a statistical processing package or processing environment (InstanceVariable.platformType).","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/platformType"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdi:function"],"id":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/function","description":"Immutable characteristic of the variable such as geographic designator, weight, temporal designation, etc. (InstanceVariable.function).","schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable"],"effectiveId":"http://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/RDF/function"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:uses"],"id":"https://w3id.org/cdif/uses","description":"Essentially the same as schema:propertyID. References to concepts that this variable measures or represents. When the dataset's distribution carries cdi:isStructuredBy (CDIF Data Structure profile), cdif:uses references the RepresentedVariable that supplies the represented-variable-level properties below, which are then NOT duplicated on the InstanceVariable.","schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/cdif/uses"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:simpleUnitOfMeasure"],"id":"https://w3id.org/cdif/simpleUnitOfMeasure","description":"The unit in which the data values are measured (kg, pound, euro), expressed as a simple string, in cases where no additional information is available (in the legacy system) or needed (as in the case of broad agreement within the community of use [i.e., ISO country codes, currencies, etc. in SDMX])","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/cdif/simpleUnitOfMeasure"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:role"],"id":"https://w3id.org/cdif/role","description":"Specifies the role this variable plays in a data structure. UnitIdentifier names the unit a row describes; Measure holds observed/derived values; Attribute qualifies an observation; Dimension addresses a cell in a multi-dimensional cube; Descriptor names the variable that a Reference column records values for (long format); ReferenceVariable holds those recorded values.","schema_type":"string","enum":["UnitIdentifier","Measure","Attribute","Dimension","Descriptor","ReferenceVariable"],"sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/cdif/role"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","cdif:physicalDataType"],"id":"https://w3id.org/cdif/physicalDataType","description":"identifier or name for the data type concept.","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/cdif/physicalDataType"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:url"],"id":"http://schema.org/url","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/url"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:url","schema:name"],"id":"http://schema.org/name","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.labeledLink"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/name"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:url","schema:description"],"id":"http://schema.org/description","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.labeledLink"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/description"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:url","schema:url"],"id":"http://schema.org/url","required":true,"schema_type":"string","format":"uri","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.labeledLink"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/url"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:maxValue"],"id":"http://schema.org/maxValue","description":"maximum numeric value in the dataset","schema_type":"number","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/maxValue"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:minValue"],"id":"http://schema.org/minValue","description":"minimum numeric value in the dataset","schema_type":"number","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/minValue"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:unitCode"],"id":"http://schema.org/unitCode","description":"URI or code identifying the unit of measure","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/unitCode"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:unitText"],"id":"http://schema.org/unitText","description":"unit of measurement as text","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/unitText"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:propertyID"],"id":"http://schema.org/propertyID","description":"identifier or name for the property concept","schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/propertyID"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:measurementTechnique"],"id":"http://schema.org/measurementTechnique","description":"Text description or URI specifying how values for the variable were obtained.","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/measurementTechnique"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:alternateName"],"id":"http://schema.org/alternateName","schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/alternateName"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:description"],"id":"http://schema.org/description","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/description"},{"path":["_anyOf","0","cdi:hasWeight","schema:name"],"id":"http://schema.org/name","description":"string label associated with the variable in the dataset serialization","required":true,"schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.variableMeasured"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/name"}]}